{"annotations":[],"blockId":"bixiu-shang","blockTitle":"必修上","body":"短歌行\n\n曹 操\n\n对酒当歌[1]，人生几何[2]！\n\n譬如朝露，去日苦多[3]。\n\n慨当以慷[4]，忧思难忘。\n\n何以解忧？唯有杜康[5]。\n\n青青子衿，悠悠我心[6]。\n\n但为君故，沉吟[7]至今。\n\n呦呦鹿鸣，食野之苹。\n\n我有嘉宾，鼓瑟吹笙[8]。\n\n明明如月，何时可掇[9]？\n\n忧从中来，不可断绝。\n\n越陌度阡[10]，枉用相存[11]。\n\n契阔谈讌[12]，心念旧恩。\n\n月明星稀，乌鹊南飞。\n\n绕树三匝[13]，何枝可依？\n\n山不厌高，海不厌深[14]。\n\n周公吐哺[15]，天下归心。","contentVersion":"yw-3e77f0f7ffa5d042a6d06763","createdAt":"2024-08-21T11:42:06Z","derivedAuthor":"曹操","derivedFrom":"lesson-1704","excerpt":"短歌行\n曹 操\n对酒当歌 [1] ，人生几何 [2] ！\n譬如朝露，去日苦多 [3] 。\n慨当以慷 [4] ，忧思难忘。\n何以解忧？唯有杜康 [5] 。\n青青子衿，悠悠我心 [6] 。\n但为君故，沉吟 [7] 至今。\n呦呦鹿鸣，食野之苹。\n我有嘉宾，鼓瑟吹笙 [8] 。\n明明如月，何时可掇 [9] ？\n忧从中来，不可断绝。\n越陌度阡 [10] ，枉用相存 [11] 。\n契阔谈讌 [12] ，心念旧恩。\n月明星稀，乌鹊南飞。\n绕树三匝 [13] ，何枝可依？\n山不厌高，海不厌深 [14] 。\n周公吐哺 [15] ，天下归心。","forumImages":[],"forumUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/t/topic/1704","id":"lesson-1704-p1","learningTasks":[],"postCount":1,"posts":[{"attachments":[],"created_at":"2024-08-21T11:42:06Z","id":"11136-1","images":[],"like_count":0,"links":[{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-1","text":"[1]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-2","text":"[2]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-3","text":"[3]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-4","text":"[4]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-5","text":"[5]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-6","text":"[6]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-7","text":"[7]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-8","text":"[8]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-9","text":"[9]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-10","text":"[10]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-11","text":"[11]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-12","text":"[12]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-13","text":"[13]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-14","text":"[14]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-15","text":"[15]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-16","text":"[16]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-17","text":"[17]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-18","text":"[18]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-19","text":"[19]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-20","text":"[20]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-21","text":"[21]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-22","text":"[22]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-23","text":"[23]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-24","text":"[24]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-25","text":"[25]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-26","text":"[26]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-27","text":"[27]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-28","text":"[28]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-29","text":"[29]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-30","text":"[30]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-31","text":"[31]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-32","text":"[32]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11136-33","text":"[33]","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-1","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-2","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-3","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-4","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-5","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-6","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-7","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-8","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-9","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-10","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-11","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-12","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-13","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-14","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-15","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-16","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-17","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-18","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-19","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-20","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-21","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-22","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-23","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-24","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-25","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-26","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-27","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-28","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-29","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-30","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-31","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-32","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11136-33","text":"↩︎","title":""}],"plainText":"短歌行\n曹 操\n对酒当歌 [1] ，人生几何 [2] ！\n譬如朝露，去日苦多 [3] 。\n慨当以慷 [4] ，忧思难忘。\n何以解忧？唯有杜康 [5] 。\n青青子衿，悠悠我心 [6] 。\n但为君故，沉吟 [7] 至今。\n呦呦鹿鸣，食野之苹。\n我有嘉宾，鼓瑟吹笙 [8] 。\n明明如月，何时可掇 [9] ？\n忧从中来，不可断绝。\n越陌度阡 [10] ，枉用相存 [11] 。\n契阔谈讌 [12] ，心念旧恩。\n月明星稀，乌鹊南飞。\n绕树三匝 [13] ，何枝可依？\n山不厌高，海不厌深 [14] 。\n周公吐哺 [15] ，天下归心。","post_number":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"updated_at":"2024-08-21T11:42:06Z"}],"readerDocument":{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1704-p1","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"面对着酒与歌，即饮酒听歌。当，也 是“对”的意思。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11136-1"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"多少。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11136-2"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"可悲的是逝去的日子太多了。这是慨 叹人生短暂。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11136-3"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"即“慷慨”。这里指宴会上的歌声激越 不平。当以，没有实义。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11136-4"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"相传是最早造酒的人。这里代指酒。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11136-5"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"语出《诗经·郑风·子 衿》，原写姑娘思念情人，这里用来形容渴望得到 贤才。子，对对方的尊称。青衿，指代周代读书人 青色交领的服装。衿，衣服的交领。悠悠，长远的 样子，形容思虑连绵不断。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11136-6"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"沉思吟味。这里指思念和倾慕贤人。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11136-7"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"语 出《诗经·小雅·鹿鸣》。苹，艾蒿。《鹿鸣》是宴 客的诗，这里用来表达招纳贤才的热情。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11136-8"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"拾取，摘取。一说同“辍”，停止。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11136-9"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"穿过纵横交错的小路。陌，东西向的 田间小路。阡，南北向的田间小路。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11136-10"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"屈驾来访。枉，这里是枉驾的意思。 用，以。存，问候、探望。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11136-11"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"久别重逢，欢饮畅谈。契阔， 聚散，这里指久别重逢。讌，同“宴”。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11136-12"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"三周。匝，周、圈。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11136-13"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"这里是仿用《管子·形势 解》中的话：“海不辞水，故能成其大；山不辞土 石，故能成其高；明主不厌人，故能成其众。”意思 是表示希望尽可能多地接纳人才。厌，满足。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11136-14"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"《史记·鲁周公世家》记载，周 公广纳贤才，正吃饭时，听到门外有士子求见，来 不及咽下嘴里的食物，把食物一吐就赶紧去接见。 这里借用这个典故，表示自己像周公一样热切殷勤 地接待贤才。吐哺，吐出嘴里的食物。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11136-15"}],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"短歌行\n\n曹 操\n\n对酒当歌","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-11136-1","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，人生几何","type":"text"},{"label":"[2]","noteId":"footnote-11136-2","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"！\n\n譬如朝露，去日苦多","type":"text"},{"label":"[3]","noteId":"footnote-11136-3","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。\n\n慨当以慷","type":"text"},{"label":"[4]","noteId":"footnote-11136-4","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，忧思难忘。\n\n何以解忧？唯有杜康","type":"text"},{"label":"[5]","noteId":"footnote-11136-5","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。\n\n青青子衿，悠悠我心","type":"text"},{"label":"[6]","noteId":"footnote-11136-6","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。\n\n但为君故，沉吟","type":"text"},{"label":"[7]","noteId":"footnote-11136-7","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"至今。\n\n呦呦鹿鸣，食野之苹。\n\n我有嘉宾，鼓瑟吹笙","type":"text"},{"label":"[8]","noteId":"footnote-11136-8","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。\n\n明明如月，何时可掇","type":"text"},{"label":"[9]","noteId":"footnote-11136-9","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"？\n\n忧从中来，不可断绝。\n\n越陌度阡","type":"text"},{"label":"[10]","noteId":"footnote-11136-10","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，枉用相存","type":"text"},{"label":"[11]","noteId":"footnote-11136-11","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。\n\n契阔谈讌","type":"text"},{"label":"[12]","noteId":"footnote-11136-12","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，心念旧恩。\n\n月明星稀，乌鹊南飞。\n\n绕树三匝","type":"text"},{"label":"[13]","noteId":"footnote-11136-13","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，何枝可依？\n\n山不厌高，海不厌深","type":"text"},{"label":"[14]","noteId":"footnote-11136-14","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。\n\n周公吐哺","type":"text"},{"label":"[15]","noteId":"footnote-11136-15","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，天下归心。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":"11136-1","sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"5487243dd8d14d65dfadc20ed544a999aaa318fc20c291462ea62c69e1eff320","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-07-30.2","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11136-1","postId":"11136-1","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11136-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11136-2","postId":"11136-1","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11136-2","text":"[2]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11136-3","postId":"11136-1","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"h